Announcement was made of a Public Hearing to be held Monday, August 26, 2013, at
6:00 P.M. in City Council Chambers, 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming, to receive
public comment regarding the intent of the City of Cheyenne to submit an application for
funding to the Wyoming Business Council’s Business Ready Community, Downtown
Development Grant Program to construct an elevated walkway over Pioneer Avenue to the Jack
R. Spiker downtown parking garage to provide access to parking for a national hotel franchise
in Cheyenne’s downtown.
